 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Structure of the indirect question",
     "texto": [
      "**Verb of asking or doubt**: chiedere, domandare, voler sapere, non sapere.",
      "**The link «se»**: it introduces the alternative: **Mi ha chiesto se avevo fame** / **Mi ha chiesto se avessi fame** (he asked me whether I was hungry).",
      "The imperfect subjunctive (**avessi, fossi, potessi**) gives the sentence greater literary elegance."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
